      "text": "Make each test write its own document with the needed property instead of using repository fixtures.\nThe first version depended on repository fixtures like F1 not canonical and F9 having comments. cargo-mutants reuses build directories, so a mutant that misroutes a write can leave a fixture rewritten, causing spurious failures counted as catches. The rule is that a test must not depend on the state of the tree, just as it must not depend on the state of the machine."
